| Server-side invalidation on logout | ✅ | Explicit `/auth/logout` call before cleanup |
| Secure token storage | ✅ | `httpOnly` cookies (enforced by backend) |
| No reliance on local-only logout | ✅ | Always calls backend first |
| Coordination with backend for session behavior | ✅ | Assumed via secure API contract |

